# 2025-12-03 08:00:26.483819
+Magical Duel Arena - Background Scene
+Overall Scene
+A dramatic night sky filled with swirling nebulae, distant stars, and two glowing moons—one silver, one crimson—hanging over an ancient magical arena floating among the clouds.
+
+Left Side: The Azure Spire (Your Tower)
+A majestic tower carved from luminous blue crystal and pale marble
+
+Glowing sapphire runes pulse rhythmically up its spiraling architecture
+
+Gentle waterfalls of liquid starlight cascade down its sides into mist below
+
+Floating around it are transparent blue spellbooks, hovering crystals, and shimmering arcane shields
+
+The air around it shimmers with cool, calm energy, and soft blue light bathes everything nearby
+
+Right Side: The Crimson Citadel (AI Tower)
+A formidable fortress of dark volcanic rock and glowing crimson ore
+
+Jagged spikes and obsidian parapets crackle with contained lightning
+
+Rivers of molten energy flow through channels in its structure
+
+Orbiting it are spinning rings of fire, smoldering runestones, and shadowy familiars
+
+The atmosphere around it wavers with heat and flickering red-orange light

