# 2025-12-03 09:26:21.415047
+make the how to play a pop up where if they click the how to play button the instruction will be displayed.
+
+How to Play Wizard Duel:
+
+Phase 1: Place Your Crystals
+
+Click empty squares on your grid (left side) to place crystals
+
+You have [time] seconds to place [number] crystals
+
+Crystals will be hidden once battle begins
+
+Phase 2: Attack Enemy
+
+Click squares on enemy grid (right side) to attack
+
+HIT = Red square (destroyed enemy crystal)
+
+MISS = Gray square (empty)
+
+Enemy will attack you after each turn
+
+Win: Destroy all enemy crystals before they destroy yours
+
+Difficulty Levels:
+
+Easy: 6×6 grid, 3 crystals, AI attacks randomly
+
+Medium: 8×8 grid, 4 crystals, AI smarter
+
+Hard: 10×10 grid, 5 crystals, AI very smart
+
+Add an "X" button to close the popup
+
+Style the popup with a semi-transparent background overlay
+
+

