# 2025-12-07 14:33:51.555447
+Skill System:
+
+On the left side of the screen, add a clickable Skills Panel with these abilities:
+
+Fireball – Cooldown: 2 turns
+Effect: Clears two vertical squares (choose column).
+Available in: All modes
+How to use: Click Fireball icon, then click any column on enemy grid.
+
+Meteor Strike – Cooldown: 4 turns
+Effect: Destroys a 2×2 square (4 squares total).
+Available in: Medium & Hard only
+How to use: Click Meteor icon, then click where to center the blast.
+
+Star Ray – Cooldown: 6 turns
+Effect: Fires 5 random shots anywhere on enemy grid.
+Available in: Medium & Hard only
+How to use: Click Star Ray icon – shots fire automatically.
+
+UI Rules:
+
+Skills appear as clickable icons on the left side.
+
+When ready: Icon glows (click to select skill).
+
+On cooldown: Icon grayed out with turn counter (ex: "3 turns").
+
+After clicking skill, follow on-screen instructions for targeting.
+
+Only one skill can be used per turn.

